        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Totyakarae ŋituŋa ŋulugelae aneni a Ŋisirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, aponi tosyomae ŋakiro alokitaabo a Moses epupete ŋituŋa, ido aponi toryamunae igiritae atemar mam ituŋanan ŋini alo Amon, kori alo Moab ŋini emaikina toloma natukot ŋina a ŋituŋa ka Akuj, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae apotu ikes nyisiryama Ŋisirael a ŋamugati ka ŋakipi, nai apotu kipaŋgata Baalam ikotere iceni Ŋisirael, kikote neni daŋ, abu Akuj kibelek ŋicen ŋulu acamito ikes Balaam tolimu, kituruwo arereŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete ŋituŋa ŋuna etubunitoe alokisil, apotu totyakasi alotuŋa a Isirael ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu pa arae ŋiletok a Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuna abu Neemia kitiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa nyetyakara ŋituŋa ŋulugelae, abu esacaradoti Eliasib, ŋolo aseunitae akiyok ŋagulei ŋuna ka Akai ka Akuj yok, ŋolo arae eyenet a Tobia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kitemok aŋuna a Tobia agule ŋina aloloman, ŋina sek ewuanakinete ikes ŋainakineta a ŋikinyom, ekinyate, ŋiboro ŋulu esitiyao alo Kai ka Akuj ka ŋatutubeta ŋapeipei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋikinyom, a epiini ka a akimyet, ŋainakineta ŋuna amaikina einanakinio neni a ŋilepi, a ŋikaeok ka ŋiketeok ŋipukei, ŋainakineta ŋuna acunununuyo aŋuna kec ka ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina etiyaere ŋakiro ŋun, amam ayoŋ alo Yerusalem, anerae alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka ŋiarei ipukat erwosit Aritaseses ŋolo a Babilon, abu ayoŋ oboŋo neni a erwosit. Kelunyar ŋirwa ŋidi, abu ayoŋ eŋit erwosit acamakin ayoŋ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oboŋo Yerusalem. Abu nai ayoŋ oyenu aronis ŋina kebu Eliasib kitiya aŋuna ainakinia Tobia agule alotooma ŋalapatui ŋuna a Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ oŋo nooi, emasa kiŋa ŋiboro a Tobia daadaŋ ŋulu aya nagule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi, abu ayoŋ olimu atemar kitaleunoe ŋagulei, ani ekaku abu ayoŋ enyakak nen ŋiboro ŋulu isitiyao alo Kai ka Akuj ka ŋainakineta a ŋikinyom ta ekinyate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ oryamu atemar keponi nyeinakin ŋilepi akimuj ŋina sek amaikina ikes eryamununeete, ido kepotu ŋilepi ka ŋikaeok ŋulu sek etiyaete alo Kai ka Akuj toloto akitare ŋimanikorin kec aŋuna ka aryamunia akimuj aŋuna kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun abu ayoŋ eŋenyak ŋikepukak a ŋituŋa eŋit otema, “Kaanukiro emyekinere Akai ka Akuj?” Abu nai ayoŋ ocunak ikes, ewuanak ikes loticisyo kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi, apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya daadaŋ yaut nakais ŋuna iŋadao ŋiboro ŋatutubeta ŋapeipei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋikinyom, a epiini ka akimyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ ayoŋ oseu ŋituŋa lu aŋuna ka akiyok ŋiboro ŋulu iŋadao nakais: Esacaradoti Semaia, eketataman a ŋikisila ka Pedaia epei a ŋilepi, arae Aman lokoku a Sakur, a ŋolo arae lokoku a Matania iŋes eŋarakinit ikes. Aŋuna ekinyomitere ŋikilyok ŋul, aponi inakinae ikes etic aneni a ŋirukitos kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totamunitetei ayoŋ, okoe Akuj kaŋ aŋuna a ŋakiro a ŋun, ido nyikimuryakis iyoŋ ŋiticisyo kaŋ ŋulu ajokak ŋulu adau ayoŋ akitiya alo Kai kon Akuj kaŋ ka aŋuna ka akilip a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Togeunae akitogogoŋ nabo ŋikisila a ŋuna a Sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋul, abu ayoŋ eŋolik alo Yudaya ŋituŋa ecuyete epiini akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, eyaununeete Yerusalem ŋaeneta a ŋikinyom ka idokonokinete losigirya kec ayaununeete daŋ ikes Yerusalem akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato epiini, ŋaraito a epiini, ŋaboboryo ka ŋiboro ca daadaŋ. Abu ayoŋ olimok ikes nyegyelanasi akimuj akoloŋit ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋituŋa a Tiro daŋ ŋulu eboiyete alotaun ayaununeete ŋikolya ka ŋiboro ŋulu egyelanaryo daadaŋ, ido togyelanakis akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato neni a ŋituŋa a Yudaya alo Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ eŋenyak ŋikapolokinitok ŋituŋa eŋit otema, “Anukiro nu ŋuna aronok ŋuna itiyaete iyes nu, ŋuna ijamuwaryata iyes akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mono apotu atapapaa kus kitiyata ŋun, ido pa mono abu Akuj yok yau ŋican daadaŋ neni yok ka lotaun yok a? Nai iyaut iyes nabo anyunyura a Akuj ace neni a Ŋisirael aŋuna ijamuwaryata akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ikaikaakini akwap iryoniar diyete ŋipukei a Yerusalem akoloŋit ŋina iŋareni eriŋa Sabato, abu ayoŋ olimu atemar togolokinoe ŋipukei daadaŋ, olimu daŋ atemar nyeŋaar ŋipukei ŋul akitodol akoloŋit ŋina elunyaror akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato. Abu daŋ ayoŋ ewuak ŋiketiyak kaŋ ŋice akitere ŋipukei, ikotere nyeyaun idiobore tooma lotaun akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋimucurus ŋulu agyelanarete ŋiboro ŋulu egelegelya topero nakwaare kiŋa etaun akuwar apei kori ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu ayoŋ olimok ikes otema, “Kaanukiro iperyoto iyes diyete kiŋa arwatata nakwaare? Ani kitiyata iyes ŋun nabo ekekamari ayoŋ iyes.” Aŋun, ameun akoloŋit ŋin, nyepona nabo ŋimucurus akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi abu ayoŋ olimok ŋilepi atemar kitaleunos, ido potu akitere ŋipukei, ikotere iricitae Sabato erae akoloŋit ŋina asegan. Okoe Akuj kaŋ, totamunite ŋakiro ŋun daŋ ikitojokit ayoŋ ka kiuryarae ayoŋ alotooma amina kon ŋina apolon ŋina nyiryaŋiryaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitoroniyarae akiitanakin ka ŋituŋa ŋulugelae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alorwa a ŋul, abu daŋ ayoŋ eŋolik Ŋiburaniyae ŋulu kepotu kiitut ŋaberu ŋuna alo Asidod, alo Amon ka Moab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
