        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido erworosi atutubet apei a ŋidwe kec aŋajep ŋina ka Asidod pa erworosi aŋajep ŋina a ŋituŋa a Yudaya, nai erworosi ŋaŋajepa a ŋituŋa a ŋulu egelegelya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ etoŋoiya ikes ka ecen, ido ebuŋa ikes ŋice orutono ŋitim kec, olimok ikes kikoŋo alokiro a Akuj otema, “Nyemaikina kipotonokis ŋidwe kus ŋulupesur kiita ŋidwe kec ŋulusapa, kori kiitununut ŋidwe kec ŋulupesur aŋuna a ŋidwe kus a ŋulusapa, kori aŋuna kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mono abu Solomon erwosit a Isirael tosec aŋuna a ŋaberu a ŋunagelae a? Anakwapin a ŋuna alalak, amam erwosit ŋolo ekwaan ka iŋes, ido amina Akuj keŋ iŋes, kituruwo Akuj iŋes erwosit, kipuka Ŋisirael daadaŋ, kikote neni daŋ, apotu ŋaberu ŋunagelae kiteseca iŋes daŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina nai isua kiwuapae ŋuna kus, ido kitiyae aronis ŋina apolon na ka oseca aneni ka Akuj yok anakiitunun ŋaberu ŋunagelae a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
