              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu ayoŋ etaleu ikes anibore a daadaŋ a ŋinigela, ido abu ewuak ŋiticisyo a ŋisacaradotin ka ŋulu a ŋilepi, ewuak ŋinituŋanan lotic keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
